@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@projectId = REPLACE_WITH_ACCESSIBLE_PROJECT_UUID
@accessToken = REPLACE_WITH_LOGIN_ACCESS_COOKIE_VALUE
@registryContractId = REPLACE_WITH_DEPLOYED_M2_REGISTRY_UUID
@watcherId = REPLACE_WITH_CREATED_TARGET_UUID
@alertId = REPLACE_WITH_RULE_GENERATED_ALERT_UUID

### The existing M5 verified login issues this Bearer-compatible access token.
GET {{baseUrl}}/monitoring/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Current repo reports unavailable until M2 deployed address/ABI integration exists.
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/monitoring/registry-contracts
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Associate an actual deployed registry target; no independent registry creation.
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/monitoring/targets
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"registryContractId":"{{registryContractId}}"}

### Inspect supported ABI signatures before subscribing.
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/monitoring/watchers/{{watcherId}}/catalog
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Use an exact signature returned by the catalog.
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/monitoring/watchers/{{watcherId}}/subscriptions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"signature":"Withdrawal(address,uint256)"}

### Save desired indexing settings. The standalone worker performs actual scans.
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/monitoring/watchers/{{watcherId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"enabled":true,"pollingSeconds":10,"confirmations":12}

### A parameter rule uses exact decimal strings.
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/monitoring/rules
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Large Withdrawal","monitoredContractId":"{{watcherId}}","eventName":"Withdrawal","condition":{"field":"amount","operator":"gt","value":"100"},"mode":"parameter","severity":"warning","enabled":true}

### Inspect actual worker health and confirmed event evidence.
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/monitoring/watchers
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Empty until a real configured worker indexes matching chain activity.
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/monitoring/events?page=1&limit=25
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Alerts are generated by matching newly indexed events, not this GET.
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/monitoring/alerts
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Acknowledge without changing the original evidence.
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/monitoring/alerts/{{alertId}}/acknowledge
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"note":"Investigating the triggering event"}

### Resolve separately, preserving acknowledgement history.
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/monitoring/alerts/{{alertId}}/resolve
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"note":"Reviewed and resolved"}
